WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.150
Your map opened. Is it in the right place?

00:04.150 --> 00:07.250
Compare several known landmarks across the map.

00:07.250 --> 00:13.500
In MapNero, Location Outside can mean
your phone is outside the map's bounds.

00:13.500 --> 00:18.100
That message alone does not prove
the file is unreferenced.

00:18.100 --> 00:23.000
Check the file format and coordinate system
before changing settings.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.500
Explore MapNero and the field guides
at mapnero dot com.
